      "content": "it's just kind of funny how you say \"it's the logical choice\"... like it actually makes sense to you. that's how it feels. like if a person is already dead to everyone else, then what's actually left? if the social part of me is gone for good, then the rest is just... a mess. it feels like there's no point to staying when the person i was is already gone.",
